<title>USA: John Wiley &amp; Sons names William Pesce COO.</title>
<headline>John Wiley &amp; Sons names William Pesce COO.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publisher John Wiley &amp; Sons Inc said it named William Pesce to the newly created position of chief operating officer, effective May 1.</p>
<p>Pesce will oversee all the company's publishing units in his new role, Wiley said.</p>
<p>He has been executive vice president and group president of the company's educational and international publishing business since February 1996.</p>
